        ]
      }
    ],
    "lite_evaluator_hardening_note": "The workbook preserves all meaningful source cells, sheet state, and relevant row/column visibility while permitting only Schedule!C2; visible Calc time serials normalize to HH:MM. The draft getter reads only the task-owned profile and accepts any matching draft, keeps the exact single-To recipient and no-attachment contract, and locally binds Delivery to an equivalent 08:45 form without a global time whitelist or extra positive keyword. The Sent-folder guard remains diagnostic."
  }
}
